Title:          declutter.tcz
Description:    A lightweight data management utility
Version:        2026.06.05.1
Author:         Cliquesoft
Original-site:  https://www.cliquesoft.org
Copying-policy: CPLv2
Size:           32K
Extension_by:   wysiwyg
Tags:           declutter user data management empty hidden directories drives archive archiving mismatch mismatched deduplicate deduplicating deduplication dryrun
Comments:       A lightweight script to perform a variety of tasks allowing an
                admin to manage user-generated data - moving or deleting it.
                Functionality includes: archiving data using before or after
                dates, cleaning mismatched data between directories or drives,
                deduplicating data between one or two directories, and removal
                of empty directories. Additional features include: each action
                being able to ignore data by data specifications, optional
                inclusion of hidden files and directories, ability to test a
                run first by operating in a 'dryrun' mode, move or delete the
                targeted data, and manipulation of directory paths when moving
                targeted data.
                ----
                  [PLANNED UPDATES]
                There are several planned updates that will eventually be
                added. Patches or donations are welcome and will expedite
                future updates. Features include:
                - A graphical interface
                - Ability to color output
                - Ability to output to different formats
                - Ability to delete invalid symlink files
                - Ability to use a RegEx with directory name manipulation
                Feature requests can be sent to: service@cliquesoft.org
                  [OTHER PROJECTS]
                Feel free to check out some of our other projects. If they are
                not in the repo yet, they will be soon. Visit our website to
                obtain them otherwise @ cliquesoft.org.
                - builder: a tool to easily build software
                - dittodata: a data backup/copy tool
                - fxWM: a lightweight window manager configured via CSS
                - web.de: a web-based desktop environment
                ----
                The coreutils.tcz package is a dependency due to the 'stat'
                applet in busybox not being part of the TC ramdisk image.
                ----
                Valid for all versions of TC
                ----
                PPI Compatible
